# REST Client-style examples. Supply variables locally; never commit tokens.
# Run create deliberately. Reuse the exact body and key on transport uncertainty.
@baseUrl = https://api.staging.evseye.com/api/v1
@riderToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY
@idempotencyKey = REPLACE_WITH_ONE_UUID_PER_INTENTIONAL_PAYMENT
@paymentRequestId = collection%3AREPLACE_WITH_RETURNED_UUID
@invoiceId = REPLACE_WITH_OWNED_INVOICE_UUID

### Check policy capabilities (does not verify gateway connectivity)
GET {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

### Create/recover the same top-up (INR 500 to 5000)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Idempotency-Key: {{idempotencyKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"purpose":"TOP_UP","amount":"500.00"}

### Alternative invoice request: use a DIFFERENT key from the top-up
POST {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Idempotency-Key: REPLACE_WITH_INVOICE_SPECIFIC_UUID
Content-Type: application/json

{"purpose":"INVOICE","invoiceId":"{{invoiceId}}","useWallet":true}

### Stored state only; does not contact gateway
GET {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/{{paymentRequestId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

### Verify genuine Razorpay SDK callback (never invent the signature)
POST {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/{{paymentRequestId}}/verify
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"razorpayOrderId":"REPLACE_FROM_SDK","razorpayPaymentId":"REPLACE_FROM_SDK","razorpaySignature":"REPLACE_FROM_SDK"}

### Recover after lost callback, app restart, cancellation, or verification timeout
POST {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/{{paymentRequestId}}/reconcile
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Supplemental recovery inventory: collections only, up to 50
GET {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}

### Explicit user abandonment only; reconcile first. This is not gateway cancellation.
POST {{baseUrl}}/rider-app/payments/orders/{{paymentRequestId}}/abandon
Authorization: Bearer {{riderToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
